<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">GROQ · SPEECH TO TEXT</view><view class="title">先听懂，再整理</view><view class="subtitle">语音转写与菜谱整理分开，减少大模型输入。</view><view class="warning">试验功能：文件直接上传 Groq。免费档有额度与频率限制；当前尚未用真实密钥验收。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning error">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><view class="heading">Groq 密钥</view><view class="note">在 console.groq.com/keys 创建 API Key。默认只在本次运行中保留，不写入厨房或菜谱备份。</view><input password value="{{keyInput}}" bindinput="secret" maxlength="4096" placeholder="{{hasKey?'密钥可用，输入可替换':'填写你的 Groq API Key'}}"/><view class="row between field"><text>记住在本机</text><switch checked="{{remember}}" bindchange="remember" color="#315e44"/></view><view class="note">开启后保存在小程序本机存储，不是系统钥匙串。</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="saveKey">保存密钥</button><button class="danger" bindtap="clearKey">清除密钥</button></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">选择短音频或视频</view><view class="note">先试 10–30 秒中文口播。支持 MP3、M4A、WAV、MP4 等，单文件不超过25MB。文件入口可从微信聊天选择；相册只接受支持的格式。</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="select">从微信文件选择</button><button bindtap="selectVideo">从相册选视频</button></view><view wx:if="{{file}}" class="note">{{file.name}} · {{file.displaySize}}</view><view class="label">转写模型</view><picker range="{{models}}" value="{{modelIndex}}" bindchange="model"><view class="picker">{{models[modelIndex]}}</view></picker><view class="row between field"><text>指定中文（关闭则自动识别）</text><switch checked="{{language==='zh'}}" bindchange="chinese" color="#315e44"/></view><button id="start-transcribe" class="primary wide" bindtap="start" disabled="{{busy}}">上传并转写</button><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="note">上传进度 {{progress}}%。上传完成后仍需等待识别。</view><button wx:if="{{busy}}" bindtap="cancel">取消</button></view><view wx:if="{{text}}" class="card"><view class="heading">识别结果</view><textarea value="{{text}}" bindinput="editText" maxlength="20000" style="height:400rpx"/><view class="note">请核对用量、数字和专有名词。保留 {{segments.length}} 个时间段用于后续步骤定位；当前还不自动截图。</view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="use">带入菜谱整理</button><button bindtap="copy">复制文字</button></view></view></view>
